<tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/100">
<tei:head xml:lang="en">Psalm 100</tei:head>
<tei:p>
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/100/1">A psalm for the thank-offering.<tei:lb/>Shout praise to the Lord, all the earth.</tei:seg> 
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/100/2">Serve the Lord with joy; come before him with singing.</tei:seg> 
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/100/3">Know that the Lord is God; he has made us, and we are his, his people and the flock of his pasture.</tei:seg> 
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/100/4">Enter into his gates with thanksgiving, and into his courts with praise; give thanks to him, bless his name.</tei:seg> 
<tei:seg corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/100/5">For the Lord is good; his kindness is forever; his faithfulness endures to all generations.</tei:seg> 
</tei:p>
</tei:div>
